    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "信号（Signal Browser Definition）：In each month, count the number of days with no trades. Define zerotrade as the number of days without trades plus (the sum of monthly turnover (vol/shrout) divided by 48*10$^5$), multiplied by 21/number of trading days per month. Take 12-month average. 组合规则（该页字段）：StockWeight=EW；LSQuantile=0.1；PortfolioPeriod=1.0个月；StartMonth=12.0；Sign=1.0；TestInOP=port sort。股票池/过滤：exchcd==1。 Notes：Also works for 12 or even 24 months.。 基线为原论文分组的多空组合（FAQ：baseline follows the original paper split；数据页写 monthly long-short following OPs）。未在该行写出的细节不补。"
    },
